.TH PSMatrixDim 3 2024-03-09 "PsyC 0.9.5" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSMatrixDim\fR \- Return the size of the dimension dim of matrix

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/maths.h>

.I
long  
.br
\fBPSMatrixDim\fR(\fIPSMatrix matrix\fR, \fIint dim\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Return the size of the dimension \fIdim\fR of \fImatrix\fR. If \fIdim\fR is out of bounds or if \fImatrix\fR is \fINULL\fR, the function will return zero.

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1)
